    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐργᾰθεῖν</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐεργᾰθεῖν</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰργᾰθεῖν</span></b> , poet. aor. 2
		inf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴργω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sever, cut off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δ᾽ αὐχένος ὦμον ἐέργαθεν</span>”
