					Il.
					5.147
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ πλευρῶν χρόα ἔργαθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.437
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hold back, check,</i>
